    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an exciting world where the earth conceals countless treasures! In this game, you\u2019ll become a master of excavation: dig pits, extract valuable resources, and sell them to build your fortune. Start with a simple shovel and gradually upgrade your tools, unlocking new opportunities and speeding up your progress. Every scoop into the soil is a chance for discovery, and every resource sold brings you closer to success. Turn hard work into an art and uncover all the secrets hidden beneath the surface!</p>",
